    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat of Devinuwara on the 21st day of December, 2015, at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing",
